[I] Ayatana Indicator Power Applet

[T] ayatana-indicator-power is an Ayatana System Indicator that shows
[T] battery and power supply status in the panel and gives access to power
[T] settings. It is part of the desktop agnostic Ayatana Indicators project,
[T] the continuation of the Unity7 system indicators.

[U] https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/ayatana-indicator-power

[A] Ayatana developers
[M] Paul Manners <paul.manners@yahoo.com>

[C] extra/desktop/mate
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 26.6.0

